  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nWork instruction\nReference: PN-81035\nSite: 4400 Bayhead Drive, Houston\nOriginator: Joss Venner\nDate: 2022-09-14\nClassification: confidential\nThis work instruction applies to: site electrician\nCompetency required: Grade 2\nFrequency: on change\n\nSTEPS\n1\n.\n \nV\ne\nn\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nh\ne\na\nd\ne\nr\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\no\n \na\nt\nm\no\ns\np\nh\ne\nr\ne\n.\n\n\n2\n.\n \nT\na\nk\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nw\ni\nc\ne\n.\n \nI\nf\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nt\nw\no\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\ns\n \nd\ni\nf\nf\ne\nr\n \nb\ny\n \nm\no\nr\ne\n \nt\nh\na\nn\n \n5\n%\n,\n \nt\na\nk\ne\n \na\n \nt\nh\ni\nr\nd\n.\n\n\n3\n.\n \nW\na\ns\nh\nd\no\nw\nn\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nb\nu\nn\nd\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nw\na\ns\nh\n \nd\no\nw\nn\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ng\nr\na\ns\ns\n.\n\n\n4\n.\n \nV\ne\nn\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nh\ne\na\nd\ne\nr\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\no\n \na\nt\nm\no\ns\np\nh\ne\nr\ne\n.\n\n\n5\n.\n \nM\no\nv\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nd\nr\nu\nm\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nl\na\ny\nd\no\nw\nn\n \na\nr\ne\na\n \na\nn\nd\n \nu\np\nd\na\nt\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\ng\ni\ns\nt\ne\nr\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\na\nm\ne\n \ns\nh\ni\nf\nt\n.\n\n\n6\n.\n \nV\ne\nn\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nh\ne\na\nd\ne\nr\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\no\n \na\nt\nm\no\ns\np\nh\ne\nr\ne\n.\n\n\n7\n.\n \nM\no\nv\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nd\nr\nu\nm\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nl\na\ny\nd\no\nw\nn\n \na\nr\ne\na\n \na\nn\nd\n \nu\np\nd\na\nt\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\ng\ni\ns\nt\ne\nr\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\na\nm\ne\n \ns\nh\ni\nf\nt\n.\n\nTOOLS\n- H2S scrubber pack\n- portable pump\n\nSTOP WORK CONDITIONS\nStop and escalate if: the isolation cannot be confirmed, the gas test fails, the\npermit does not match the work, or you are asked to sign for someone not present.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
