  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nStandard operating instruction\nReference: PN-47344\nSite: Jurong Logistics Bay 4, Singapore\nOriginator: Abebe Tesfaye\nDate: 2023-06-09\nClassification: restricted — programme\nPURPOSE\nTo define the controlled method for receiving and quarantining an unregistered consignment.\n\nSCOPE\nCota station,Plot 6 and all associated contractors. This instruction supersedes all previous revisions.\n\nRESPONSIBILITIES\nSite manager holds the permit. The procurement officer holds the gas test.\nNobody else holds anything. In particular the verifier does not hold the permit,\nwhich is deliberate and has been raised twice.\n\nMETHOD — SUMMARY\n1. Confirm isolation and lock. 2. Confirm gas test within limits.\n3. Break the service. 4. Record. 5. Report.\n\nMETHOD — DETAIL\n3\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nr\ne\nl\ny\n \no\nn\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\nr\ne\nv\ni\no\nu\ns\n \ns\nh\ni\nf\nt\n \nr\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nf\no\nr\n \nc\no\nn\nt\ni\nn\nu\ni\nt\ny\n.\n\n\n4\n.\n \nI\nf\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n \ni\ns\n \no\nu\nt\ns\ni\nd\ne\n \nl\ni\nm\ni\nt\ns\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n \na\nn\nd\n \nd\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nr\ne\ns\nu\nm\ne\n \nw\ni\nt\nh\no\nu\nt\n \na\n \nn\ne\nw\n \nt\ne\ns\nt\n.\n\n\n5\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nr\ne\nl\ny\n \no\nn\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\nr\ne\nv\ni\no\nu\ns\n \ns\nh\ni\nf\nt\n \nr\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nf\no\nr\n \nc\no\nn\nt\ni\nn\nu\ni\nt\ny\n.\n\n\n6\n.\n \nE\ns\nc\na\nl\na\nt\ne\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nd\nu\nt\ny\n \nm\na\nn\na\ng\ne\nr\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \ns\ne\nl\nf\n-\na\nu\nt\nh\no\nr\ni\ns\ne\n.\n\n\n7\n.\n \nR\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nm\na\ns\ns\n.\n \nA\n \nv\no\nl\nu\nm\ne\n \nr\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nw\ni\nl\nl\n \nb\ne\n \nr\ne\nc\no\nn\nc\ni\nl\ne\nd\n \nl\na\nt\ne\nr\n \na\nn\nd\n \nw\ni\nl\nl\n \nn\no\nt\n \nm\na\nt\nc\nh\n.\n\nEXCEPTIONS\nAny deviation is a nonconformity and is raised within one shift.\n\nKnown deviation: see the deviation log for this procedure. There are 14 open.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
