  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nWork instruction\nReference: PN-43449\nSite: Sundowner Airfield, Ward Island, Anchorage\nOriginator: Rowan Kestrel\nDate: 2024-07-28\nClassification: confidential\nThis work instruction applies to: foreman\nCompetency required: Competent person\nFrequency: per task\n\nSTEPS\n1\n.\n \nV\ne\nn\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nh\ne\na\nd\ne\nr\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\no\n \na\nt\nm\no\ns\np\nh\ne\nr\ne\n.\n\n\n2\n.\n \nT\na\nk\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nw\ni\nc\ne\n.\n \nI\nf\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nt\nw\no\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\ns\n \nd\ni\nf\nf\ne\nr\n \nb\ny\n \nm\no\nr\ne\n \nt\nh\na\nn\n \n5\n%\n,\n \nt\na\nk\ne\n \na\n \nt\nh\ni\nr\nd\n.\n\n\n3\n.\n \nR\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\na\nm\np\nl\ne\n \np\no\ni\nn\nt\n \nn\nu\nm\nb\ne\nr\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\na\nm\np\nl\ne\n \np\no\ni\nn\nt\n \nd\ne\ns\nc\nr\ni\np\nt\ni\no\nn\n.\n\n\n4\n.\n \nB\nr\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\ne\nr\nm\ni\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nj\no\nb\n.\n \nI\nf\n \ny\no\nu\n \nc\na\nn\nn\no\nt\n \nf\ni\nn\nd\n \ni\nt\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n.\n\n\n5\n.\n \nW\na\ns\nh\nd\no\nw\nn\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nb\nu\nn\nd\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nw\na\ns\nh\n \nd\no\nw\nn\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ng\nr\na\ns\ns\n.\n\n\n6\n.\n \nB\nr\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\ne\nr\nm\ni\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nj\no\nb\n.\n \nI\nf\n \ny\no\nu\n \nc\na\nn\nn\no\nt\n \nf\ni\nn\nd\n \ni\nt\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n.\n\nTOOLS\n-  intrinsically safe lamp\n- field notebook\n- lock and tag set\n- survey grade camera\n\nSTOP WORK CONDITIONS\nStop and escalate if: the isolation cannot be confirmed, the gas test fails, the\npermit does not match the work, or you are asked to sign for someone not present.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
