  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nStandard operating instruction\nReference: PN-73885\nSite: Cota station,Plot 6, Bogotá\nOriginator: Hector Villegas\nDate: 2024-06-17\nClassification: need to know\nPURPOSE\nTo define the controlled method for conducting a controlled burn on plantation.\n\nSCOPE\nCota station,Plot 6 and all associated contractors. This instruction supersedes all previous revisions.\n\nRESPONSIBILITIES\nSite manager holds the permit. The quality lead holds the gas test.\nNobody else holds anything. In particular the verifier does not hold the permit,\nwhich is deliberate and has been raised twice.\n\nMETHOD — SUMMARY\n1. Confirm isolation and lock. 2. Confirm gas test within limits.\n3. Break the service. 4. Record. 5. Report.\n\nMETHOD — DETAIL\n3\n.\n \nE\ns\nc\na\nl\na\nt\ne\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nd\nu\nt\ny\n \nm\na\nn\na\ng\ne\nr\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \ns\ne\nl\nf\n-\na\nu\nt\nh\no\nr\ni\ns\ne\n.\n\n\n4\n.\n \nD\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nr\ne\nl\ny\n \no\nn\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\nr\ne\nv\ni\no\nu\ns\n \ns\nh\ni\nf\nt\n \nr\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nf\no\nr\n \nc\no\nn\nt\ni\nn\nu\ni\nt\ny\n.\n\n\n5\n.\n \nI\nf\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n \ni\ns\n \no\nu\nt\ns\ni\nd\ne\n \nl\ni\nm\ni\nt\ns\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n \na\nn\nd\n \nd\no\n \nn\no\nt\n \nr\ne\ns\nu\nm\ne\n \nw\ni\nt\nh\no\nu\nt\n \na\n \nn\ne\nw\n \nt\ne\ns\nt\n.\n\n\n6\n.\n \nR\ne\nc\no\nr\nd\n \nt\nh\ne\n \na\nc\nt\nu\na\nl\n \ni\nn\ns\nt\nr\nu\nm\ne\nn\nt\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\ne\nt\np\no\ni\nn\nt\n.\n\nEXCEPTIONS\nAny deviation is a nonconformity and is raised within one shift.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
