  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nWork instruction\nReference: PN-51198\nSite: Sundowner Airfield, Ward Island, Anchorage\nOriginator: Lubomir Yezhov\nDate: 2024-11-18\nClassification: unlimited\nThis work instruction applies to: document controller\nCompetency required: Authorised person\nFrequency: on change\n\nSTEPS\n1\n.\n \nB\nr\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\ne\nr\nm\ni\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nj\no\nb\n.\n \nI\nf\n \ny\no\nu\n \nc\na\nn\nn\no\nt\n \nf\ni\nn\nd\n \ni\nt\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n.\n\n\n2\n.\n \nT\na\nk\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nw\ni\nc\ne\n.\n \nI\nf\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nt\nw\no\n \nr\ne\na\nd\ni\nn\ng\ns\n \nd\ni\nf\nf\ne\nr\n \nb\ny\n \nm\no\nr\ne\n \nt\nh\na\nn\n \n5\n%\n,\n \nt\na\nk\ne\n \na\n \nt\nh\ni\nr\nd\n.\n\n\n3\n.\n \nB\nr\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\ne\nr\nm\ni\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nj\no\nb\n.\n \nI\nf\n \ny\no\nu\n \nc\na\nn\nn\no\nt\n \nf\ni\nn\nd\n \ni\nt\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n.\n\n\n4\n.\n \nB\nr\ni\nn\ng\n \nt\nh\ne\n \np\ne\nr\nm\ni\nt\n \nt\no\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nj\no\nb\n.\n \nI\nf\n \ny\no\nu\n \nc\na\nn\nn\no\nt\n \nf\ni\nn\nd\n \ni\nt\n,\n \ns\nt\no\np\n.\n\n\n5\n.\n \nC\no\nn\nf\ni\nr\nm\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ni\ns\no\nl\na\nt\ni\no\nn\n \nv\na\nl\nv\ne\n \ni\ns\n \np\nh\ny\ns\ni\nc\na\nl\nl\ny\n \nl\no\nc\nk\ne\nd\n \na\nn\nd\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nl\no\nc\nk\n \ni\ns\n \ny\no\nu\nr\ns\n.\n\n\n6\n.\n \nS\ne\na\nl\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\na\nm\np\nl\ne\n \na\nn\nd\n \nw\nr\ni\nt\ne\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nt\ni\nm\ne\n \no\nn\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\ne\na\nl\n,\n \nn\no\nt\n \no\nn\nl\ny\n \no\nn\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ns\nh\ne\ne\nt\n.\n\n\n7\n.\n \nC\no\nn\nf\ni\nr\nm\n \nt\nh\ne\n \ni\ns\no\nl\na\nt\ni\no\nn\n \nv\na\nl\nv\ne\n \ni\ns\n \np\nh\ny\ns\ni\nc\na\nl\nl\ny\n \nl\no\nc\nk\ne\nd\n \na\nn\nd\n \nt\nh\ne\n \nl\no\nc\nk\n \ni\ns\n \ny\no\nu\nr\ns\n.\n\nTOOLS\n- field notebook\n- calibrated gas detector\n\nSTOP WORK CONDITIONS\nStop and escalate if: the isolation cannot be confirmed, the gas test fails, the\npermit does not match the work, or you are asked to sign for someone not present.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
