  "body": "PENTEX INDUSTRIES WORLDWIDE, INC.\nRisk assessment\nReference: PN-17654\nSite: Kilifi Road, Tiwi, Nairobi\nOriginator: Abebe Tesfaye\nDate: 2019-08-23\nClassification: internal only\nRisk assessment for: work in the flare radiation zone\n\nHAZARD\n- inhalation\n- inhalation\n- fire\n- eye contact\n- heat stress\n\nEXPOSURE\n1 workers, indoors. Duration 334 minutes.\n\nCONTROL HIERARCHY\nElimination is not available. Substitution is not available.\nAdministrative control is the primary control and it is the weakest of the five.\nPPE: fall arrest, hearing protection, gloves\n\nREVIEW TRIGGER\nOn incident, on change of process, on change of personnel, or at twelve months.\n\nRetention: statutory period. Destroy under Standing Order 4.\nThis document is a Pentex Group internal record.",
